# Permanent releases — never pruned from R2 or GitHub.
#
# One tag per line, as published: <comp>/<stamp>
# A bare stamp also matches. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# These are kept IN ADDITION to the newest 3 stable / 1 beta. An empty
# file (the default) pins nothing.
#
# Examples:
#   umbree/v0.1.0.2026.01.01.deadbeef
#   umbreed/v0.2.0.2026.06.01.abcd1234
